 "https://si.imgix.net/24754f3f/uploads/origins/2b3e3936-6bf1-47ed-99b7-46af210bb6f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f43aec70715198355dffa623d3a369e3, https://si.imgix.net/24754f3f/uploads/origins/2b3e3936-6bf1-47ed-99b7-46af210bb6f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=6321dbcdf4c10ee00fe93dd776084623 2x, https://si.imgix.net/24754f3f/uploads/origins/2b3e3936-6bf1-47ed-99b7-46af210bb6f6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b3828284ed2ab2dab9dd2f65f6c33027 3x"}, "body": "こんにちは！僕のオリジナルキャラクターを描いてほしいんだ。\n\n彼女の名前はソフィア、人間の魂を宿した生き人形です。その不気味な外見とは裏腹に、彼女は優しくて善意の心を持っています。\n\n人形のように手足がボールジョイントになっています。\n\nポーズはお任せします！\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/sophia-drusilla-ganymede-SzeTgUi", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yuugiriaoha/works/3", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 2089247, "client_id": 2565216, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/14657fac/uploads/origins/ef78186c-ba69-472b-8d40-e389bcfe0a9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a45c295dddd987f4f07ae1da38fbf6e", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/14657fac/uploads/origins/ef78186c-ba69-472b-8d40-e389bcfe0a9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a45c295dddd987f4f07ae1da38fbf6e, https://si.imgix.net/14657fac/uploads/origins/ef78186c-ba69-472b-8d40-e389bcfe0a9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cecb24b9f4eb56716c2a976124289cdf 2x, https://si.imgix.net/14657fac/uploads/origins/ef78186c-ba69-472b-8d40-e389bcfe0a9b?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=cb391abeb149ec7a47230db4d8f99df3 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_u